# Node builds need the complete Cargo workspace and its patched dependencies.
**
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates
!crates/**
!tools
!tools/**
!apps
!apps/**
!vendor
!vendor/**

# Local configuration and generated outputs must not enter the builder layers.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.git
**/.cache
**/.metals
**/.scala-build
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.codex
**/.claude
**/.DS_Store
**/target
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.business-artifacts.*
**/_build
**/*.pyc
**/*.beam
**/*.class
**/*.tar
